      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "PLUGINPIPELINE FIRES HOOKS ONLY ON STORE, APPEND AND FORGET. Verified enumeration of every write-ish REST route as of 2026-08-16: POST /memories, POST .../append and DELETE /memories/{name} go through PluginPipeline and fire sinks. FOUR ROUTES BYPASS IT ENTIRELY and fire nothing: PATCH /memories/{name} (mutates via TryUpdateEntry), POST .../copy (store.CopyMemory), POST .../copy-from-client (WriteCarriedCopy), POST /import (ImportFromStream). Their MCP counterparts also fire nothing (link-\u003EUpdat",
