      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "contentPreview": "MAINTENANCE MUST NEVER BE A PASSENGER ON THE EMBEDDINGS REGISTRATION. This defect existed in BOTH the server and the CLI and the review found neither. MaintenanceEventSink (ref-linking \u002B orphan marking) is constructed with \u0060new MaintenanceEventSink()\u0060, takes no arguments and has NO dependency on embeddings, yet in both places it was registered only inside an embeddings-available branch. Server (Program.cs, fixed): one AddSingleton\u003CIMemoryEventSink\u003E nested three conditionals deep, so maintenance",
