    {
      "chunkIndex": 4,
      "contentPreview": "TWO ASYMMETRIES THIS BRANCH INTRODUCED AND THEN HAD TO REMOVE \u2014 both worth checking for in any future adapter. (1) EventSinkOperationHook first looped sinks directly, WITHOUT CompositeEventSink\u0027s per-sink try/catch. MaintenanceEventSink cannot throw (it wraps its own body) but EntityTypingEventHandler.PromoteAsync has NO try/catch and LoadIndex/GetEntityFactStore/TypeAsync/TryUpdateEntry can all throw \u2014 so on REST a throw propagated into PluginPipeline and 5xx\u0027d a write that HAD ALREADY SUCCEEDE",
