      "chunkIndex": 5,
      "contentPreview": "THE EXCLUSION RULE, AND THE DOUBLE-REGISTRATION BUG IT DID NOT COVER. EventSinkOperationHook fires \u0060sinks.Where(s =\u003E s is not IMemoryOperationHook)\u0060 because BuiltInEmbeddingsService implements both interfaces and is separately registered as a hook, so firing it from the adapter too would embed every REST write twice. The predicate is a TYPE test, not a registration test; a container-registration test is not available (it would need GetServices\u003CIMemoryOperationHook\u003E() inside the factory producing",
